<item><title>Nurse takes newborn home for oxygen after Malawi clinic loses power</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/nurse-takes-newborn-home-for-oxygen-after-malawi-clinic-4eed39/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/nurse-takes-newborn-home-for-oxygen-after-malawi-clinic-4eed39/</guid><category>Malawi</category><description>The baby was stabilised at the nurse’s home and referred to Mitundu Community Hospital, while the clinic’s outage has lasted about two and a half months.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 09:05:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" length="31502" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Malawian actress Yvonne Scott wins role in Nigerian film</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawian-actress-yvonne-scott-wins-role-in-nigerian-film-aa6a96/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawian-actress-yvonne-scott-wins-role-in-nigerian-film-aa6a96/</guid><category>Malawi</category><description>The creative team behind Ikenga: The Last Festival selected Scott after her performances in Malawi’s entertainment industry.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 04:51:16 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" length="31502" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
